EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

National College Decision Day is right around the corner. Have you decided where you will be attending this fall? If you are still considering Arizona State University, we encourage you to pay the enrollment deposit by May 1 to begin your housing and orientation selection. This is easily done on My ASU (https://my.asu.edu) under Important Next Steps in the Priority Task box.

Your financial aid package should be available on the Finances tab. If you have questions regarding tuition, I find the websites below useful for determining if ASU is the right financial fit, along with being the right academic fit.

Tuition Estimator - https://students.asu.edu/tuition
Housing Costs - https://housing.asu.edu/
Student Budget Worksheet - https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget

If you haven’t quite made your decision yet, please let me know if I can be of assistance. I am happy to answer any questions you may have about ASU!

If you have chosen a different institution and are no longer considering ASU as an option, also let me know so I can provide instructions on how to cancel your admission.

We hope to welcome you to our Sun Devil family!

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
